WEBVTT

00:12:59.704 --> 00:13:04.121
the film industry, it's critical that we
have that conversation about the Oscars

00:13:04.121 --> 00:13:06.871
as part of a broader conversation that
should be tackling year round.

00:13:07.204 --> 00:13:10.079
I also have to say, shout out to Epuron,

00:13:10.079 --> 00:13:11.954
who came up with the hashtag
Oscars so white,

00:13:12.162 --> 00:13:14.954
there's very little chance that we'd be
having this conversation right now if

00:13:14.954 --> 00:13:15.954
it wasn't for her.

00:13:15.996 --> 00:13:18.704
And I think it's really important
that we remember that Oscars

00:13:18.704 --> 00:13:21.329
so white is not just about black actors,

00:13:21.496 --> 00:13:28.287
it is about all non-white men and making
sure that everyone is represented in

00:13:28.287 --> 00:13:32.246
the culture because we have a better
culture when that's true